usage: module-nav source [-h] [--code] [--grep SRC_GREP] [--batch SRC_BATCH] [name]

positional arguments:
  name               Class name (e.g. BLinkPad). Omit when using --batch.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --code             Show full source code with line numbers
  --grep SRC_GREP    Search regex within the class source
  --batch SRC_BATCH  CSV of class names to read in sequence (e.g. BLinkPad,BAlarmService)
